@baseUrl = https://YOUR-TUNNEL.trycloudflare.com
@deviceKey = YOUR_PRIVATE_KIOSK_KEY
@movieId = 28
@showtimeId = 149
@seatId = 1
@holdId = COPY_HOLD_ID_FROM_RESPONSE

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Movies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/movies
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}

### Date, time and free seat count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/showtimes?movie_id={{movieId}}&limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}

### Seat map
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/showtimes/{{showtimeId}}/seats
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}

### Hold (use seat id, not the visible row number)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/bookings/holds
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"showtime_id":{{showtimeId}},"seat_ids":[{{seatId}}]}

### Successful local RFID reading — no card data sent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/payments/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hold_id":"{{holdId}}","payment_success":true}

### Final failure (a separate hold; do not use this after a successful purchase)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/payments/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hold_id":"{{holdId}}","payment_success":false}

### Release an unpaid hold
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/bookings/holds/{{holdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{deviceKey}}
